<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Income tax: gross income and taxable income (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>{@nm@} has a monthly basic salary of Ksh \( {@B0@} \), a house allowance of Ksh \( {@H0@} \) and a {@aw@} allowance of Ksh \( {@M0@} \). Each month Ksh \( {@N0@} \) is deducted for NSSF before tax is calculated.</p>
<p>(a) Find the gross monthly income.</p>
<div>Gross income \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Find the monthly taxable income.</p>
<div>Taxable income \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<p>(c) Find the annual taxable income.</p>
<div>Annual taxable income \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>(a)</strong> Allowances are part of income: gross income \( = {@B0@} + {@H0@} + {@M0@} = {@G0@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> The NSSF deduction is taken off <em>before</em> tax is calculated: taxable income \( = {@G0@} - {@N0@} = {@TI@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(c)</strong> \( 12 \times {@TI@} = {@12*TI@} \).</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
